Tidak, tunggu dulu./
Biarkan dia pergi.

482
00:34:45,792 --> 00:34:48,002
Kasih tahu dulu siapa kau.

483
00:34:48,044 --> 00:34:49,212
Ya.

484
00:34:49,253 --> 00:34:50,922
Namaku Putri Salju.

485
00:34:54,342 --> 00:34:56,469
Putri Salju?/
Sang putri?

486
00:34:56,511 --> 00:34:57,637
Kurasa ini jebakan.

487
00:34:57,678 --> 00:34:59,764
Tapi dia butuh bantuan kita.

488
00:34:59,806 --> 00:35:01,974
Masih ada yang ngira dia hantu?/
Tunggu. Kau mau ke mana?

489
00:35:02,016 --> 00:35:04,102
Sejauh mungkin dari kastil.

490
00:35:04,143 --> 00:35:05,561
Itu tidak cukup./
Kenapa?

491
00:35:09,357 --> 00:35:11,484
Sebenarnya,
ratu ingin membunuhku.

492
00:35:11,526 --> 00:35:13,986
Dia benar-benar mau bunuh kau?

493
00:35:14,028 --> 00:35:15,321
Itu mengerikan.

494
00:35:15,363 --> 00:35:18,241
Makanya kau harus pergi.

495
00:35:18,282 --> 00:35:20,618
Kau bisa tinggal di sini
sampai kau tahu mau ke mana.

496
00:35:20,660 --> 00:35:23,037
Apa?/
Kurasa itu ide bagus.

497
00:35:23,079 --> 00:35:24,372
Tunggu dulu.

498
00:35:24,413 --> 00:35:26,582
Baru pertama kali
ada manusia datang ke pondok ini

499
00:35:26,624 --> 00:35:28,000
setelah 275 tahun

500
00:35:28,042 --> 00:35:29,460
dan kau mau dia tinggal?

501
00:35:29,502 --> 00:35:31,045
Dia barusan bilang

502
00:35:31,087 --> 00:35:32,839
275 tahun?

503
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:35,550
274, tepatnya.

504
00:35:35,591 --> 00:35:37,260
Kami setua pohon-pohon ini.

505
00:35:37,802 --> 00:35:40,471
Orang tuaku selalu bilang
hutan ini tempat yang ajaib.

506
00:35:40,513 --> 00:35:43,516
Dan aku selalu bilang
manusia cuma bawa masalah.

507
00:35:43,558 --> 00:35:45,143
Maaf, aku belum tahu namamu.

508
00:35:45,977 --> 00:35:48,771
Izinkan aku mengenalkan, urut abjad.

509
00:35:48,813 --> 00:35:50,481
Bashful. Dopey.

510
00:35:50,523 --> 00:35:52,024
Grumpy. Happy.

511
00:35:52,066 --> 00:35:53,484
Sleepy. Sneezy.

512
00:35:53,526 --> 00:35:55,069
Dan aku Doc.

513
00:35:55,111 --> 00:35:57,905
Kau bilang tadi urutan
abjad terbalik sekarang.

514
00:35:57,947 --> 00:35:59,365
Itu kan waktu terakhir.

515
00:35:59,407 --> 00:36:00,908
Jadi, kalau terbalik,

516
00:36:00,950 --> 00:36:03,911
Sneezy, Sleepy, Happy,
Grumpy, Dopey, Doc, Bashful.

517
00:36:03,953 --> 00:36:05,705
Ya ampun.

518
00:36:05,746 --> 00:36:07,415
Kok dia bisa ingat?

519
00:36:07,456 --> 00:36:10,001
Ibuku selalu ajarin
pentingnya mengingat nama.

520
00:36:10,042 --> 00:36:12,503
Kalau diurut dari jempol kaki terpanjang,

521
00:36:12,545 --> 00:36:13,921
