522
00:36:15,756 --> 00:36:16,757
Kalau itu membantu.

523
00:36:17,133 --> 00:36:20,386
Sebenarnya kenapa kalian di hutan ini?

524
00:36:20,428 --> 00:36:23,472
Tugas kami menambang di tambang.

525
00:36:23,514 --> 00:36:25,141
Kau akan kaget sama isinya.

526
00:36:25,183 --> 00:36:27,059
Batu berkilau segala jenis.

527
00:36:27,101 --> 00:36:28,603
Tempat di mana sihir masih ada.

528
00:36:28,644 --> 00:36:30,688
Tapi tak lama kalau dia di sini!

529
00:36:30,730 --> 00:36:32,148
Lihat udah jam segini.

530
00:36:34,317 --> 00:36:38,487
Yang penting Putri Salju
aman di rumah kami.

531
00:36:38,529 --> 00:36:39,822
Benar kan, teman-teman?/
Ya.

532
00:36:40,198 --> 00:36:41,616
Ya./
Aku keberatan.

533
00:36:41,657 --> 00:36:43,492
Tercatat. Abaikan dia.

534
00:36:49,624 --> 00:36:51,125
Mungkin aku cuma nginep semalam.

535
00:36:51,167 --> 00:36:53,002
Semalam aja.
Habis itu dia pergi.

536
00:36:53,044 --> 00:36:55,379
Kau bisa tidur di sini./
Ukurannya berapa?

537
00:36:55,421 --> 00:36:57,840
Aku suka pesta tidur./
Kami ada cadangan di atas.

538
00:36:57,882 --> 00:36:59,800
Kau aman dari ratu di sini.

539
00:37:07,642 --> 00:37:10,102
Cermin Ajaib di dinding,

540
00:37:10,895 --> 00:37:14,398
siapa yang paling cantik?

541
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:17,443
Jauh di luar tembok istana,

542
00:37:17,485 --> 00:37:20,238
di suatu tempat di hutan,

543
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:22,740
Putri Salju,

544
00:37:22,782 --> 00:37:24,951
dialah yang tercantik.

545
00:37:24,992 --> 00:37:25,952
Tidak.

546
00:37:25,993 --> 00:37:28,871
Aku hanya bicara yang benar.

547
00:37:28,913 --> 00:37:31,374
Yang tercantik masih hidup.

548
00:37:31,415 --> 00:37:33,918
Dan itu bukan kau.

549
00:37:53,062 --> 00:37:55,481
<i>Sepertinya kita kena masalah</i>

550
00:37:56,440 --> 00:37:58,776
<i>Ada yang bikin kacau</i>

551
00:37:59,443 --> 00:38:04,031
<i>Dan siapa yang harus beresin?</i>

552
00:38:05,241 --> 00:38:06,993
<i>Tebak saja</i>

553
00:38:07,034 --> 00:38:09,996
<i>Jadi, apa hukuman
Untuk seorang pengkhianat?</i>

554
00:38:10,496 --> 00:38:13,791
<i>Pengecut hina seperti dia?</i>

555
00:38:14,333 --> 00:38:15,835
<i>Hancurkan dia</i>

556
00:38:16,502 --> 00:38:18,796
<i>Lenyapkan dia</i>

557
00:38:19,380 --> 00:38:21,382
<i>Karena, ya</i>

558
00:38:22,550 --> 00:38:23,926
<i>Aku bisa</i>

559
00:38:28,180 --> 00:38:30,599
Berani-beraninya kau melawanku?

560
00:38:30,641 --> 00:38:32,810
Aku tidak pantas dimaafkan.

561
00:38:32,852 --> 00:38:35,271
Tapi kalau hatimu
masih ada belas kasihan,

562
00:38:35,313 --> 00:38:36,856
