563
00:38:38,024 --> 00:38:39,317
tunjukkan itu padanya.

564
00:38:44,864 --> 00:38:46,907
<i>Mungkin aku kurang jelas</i>

565
00:38:46,949 --> 00:38:48,701
<i>Tapi aku tak butuh nasihatmu</i>

566
00:38:48,743 --> 00:38:50,828
<i>Malah aku senang dengarnya</i>

567
00:38:50,870 --> 00:38:52,580
<i>Menyuruhku bersikap baik</i>

568
00:38:52,621 --> 00:38:54,915
<i>Tapi baik tak bikin apa-apa</i>

569
00:38:54,957 --> 00:38:56,834
<i>Baik tak bikin semuanya selesai</i>

570
00:38:56,876 --> 00:38:59,128
<i>Gadis ambisius harus kejam</i>

571
00:38:59,170 --> 00:39:00,921
<i>Dan itu seru banget!</i>

572
00:39:00,963 --> 00:39:03,841
<i>Ini akan seru!</i>

573
00:39:03,883 --> 00:39:08,512
<i>Semua adil kalau kau pakai mahkota</i>

574
00:39:08,554 --> 00:39:11,223
<i>Jadi ratu berarti suka-suka aku</i>

575
00:39:12,141 --> 00:39:14,268
<i>Aku bisa ampuni</i>

576
00:39:14,310 --> 00:39:16,354
<i>Atau hancurkan kau</i>

577
00:39:16,395 --> 00:39:19,565
<i>Sekejap aku bisa tundukkan dunia</i>

578
00:39:19,607 --> 00:39:21,859
<i>Aku bisa maafkan, lupakan</i>

579
00:39:21,901 --> 00:39:24,195
<i>Biar kau hidup, semua beres</i>

580
00:39:24,236 --> 00:39:25,988
<i>Tapi dari awal aku tak punya hati</i>

581
00:39:26,030 --> 00:39:27,448
<i>Kau kan tahu itu</i>

582
00:39:27,490 --> 00:39:31,994
<i>Jadi, sayang, semua adil</i>

583
00:39:32,036 --> 00:39:35,081
<i>Kalau kau yang tercantik</i>

584
00:39:39,418 --> 00:39:41,712
<i>Mungkin kau pernah dengar</i>

585
00:39:41,754 --> 00:39:45,132
<i>Kecantikan sejati datang dari dalam</i>

586
00:39:45,174 --> 00:39:47,593
<i>Kalau ada yang bilang begitu</i>

587
00:39:47,635 --> 00:39:49,053
<i>Dia bohong</i>

588
00:39:49,095 --> 00:39:51,180
<i>Cantik itu emas, kemilau</i>

589
00:39:51,222 --> 00:39:53,974
<i>Permata, perhiasan</i>

590
00:39:54,475 --> 00:39:55,893
<i>Cantik itu kuasa</i>

591
00:39:55,935 --> 00:40:00,606
<i>Itu berarti aku yang atur semua</i>

592
00:40:00,648 --> 00:40:02,858
<i>Semua adil</i>

593
00:40:02,900 --> 00:40:06,070
<i>Kalau kau pakai mahkota</i>

594
00:40:06,112 --> 00:40:09,281
<i>Siapa berani menghalangiku?/</i>
<i>Halangi dia</i>

595
00:40:09,323 --> 00:40:11,492
<i>Hati-hati</i>

596
00:40:11,534 --> 00:40:12,952
<i>Kalau kau kecewain aku</i>

597
00:40:12,993 --> 00:40:15,037
<i>Kecewa, kecewa, kecewa</i>

598
00:40:15,079 --> 00:40:16,664
<i>Kau akan di penjara bawah tanah/</i>
<i>Di penjara bawah tanah</i>

599
00:40:16,705 --> 00:40:18,499
<i>Tapi kalau kau berhasil</i>

600
00:40:18,541 --> 00:40:20,459
<i>Aku lanjut, tak terkalahkan</i>

601
00:40:20,501 --> 00:40:22,753
<i>Tak ragu lagi saat aku panggil</i>

602
00:40:22,795 --> 00:40:24,755
<i>"Cermin di dinding"/</i>
<i>Cermin di dinding</i>

603
00:40:25,297 --> 00:40:28,467
<i>"Katakan, siapa tercantik?"</i>

604
00:40:28,509 --> 00:40:31,846
<i>"Siapa yang paling cantik?"</i>

605
00:40:31,887 --> 00:40:38,227
<i>Pastinya aku jawabannya</i>

606
00:40:38,269 --> 00:40:40,521
Kapten, cari di hutan.

607
00:40:41,021 --> 00:40:42,606
Temukan Putri Salju.

608
00:40:42,648 --> 00:40:46,152
Dan jangan kembali tanpa dia.

609
00:40:49,113 --> 00:40:52,575
<i>Semua adil</i>

610
00:40:53,117 --> 00:40:56,579
<i>Saat kau yang tercantik</i>

611
00:40:56,620 --> 00:40:58,789
<i>Dari semua/</i>
<i>Cermin di dinding</i>

612
00:40:58,831 --> 00:41:00,749
<i>Siapa yang tercantik di dunia?</i>

613
00:41:04,837 --> 00:41:06,755
Ini tak adil.

614
00:41:07,506 --> 00:41:09,800
Sekarang pagi, dia masih di sini.

615
00:41:09,842 --> 00:41:11,802
Mereka pasti akan mencarinya,

616
00:41:11,844 --> 00:41:14,096
